    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Seconds since Silver job last reported",
      "description": "now() minus the silver_job heartbeat: the job reports every 15 s while it is alive (\"alive\") and after every batch (\"batch N\"), so this is time since the Silver job last reported, not since data arrived. Green under 30 s, amber 30 to 120 s, red above 120 s.",
